795	        `Your LCP is ${lcpSec}s — Google's 'Needs Improvement' range is 2.5-4.0s. Your hero content takes ${lcpSec} seconds to appear, which increases bounce rate by approximately ${Math.round((lcpMs - 2500) / 100)}%.`,
